        "title": {
          "en": "Linux on M4 Encounters 'Forgetful CPU' Phenomenon",
          "zh": "M4芯片运行Linux遭遇“善忘CPU”现象"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "A blog post identifies an issue, termed 'The Forgetful CPU,' affecting Linux installations on Apple M4 chips.",
          "zh": "一篇博客文章指出，在苹果M4芯片上安装Linux时，存在一个被称为“善忘CPU”的问题。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The reported issue is termed 'The Forgetful CPU.'",
            "The problem occurs when running Linux.",
            "The affected hardware platform is the M4 chip."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "报告的问题被称为“善忘CPU”。",
            "该问题在运行Linux时出现。",
            "受影响的硬件平台是M4芯片。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This indicates potential challenges for developers and users aiming to install and operate Linux on the latest Apple M4 hardware, which could affect advanced computing applications including those in AI research and development. Further investigation into the CPU's behavior may be required.",
          "zh": "这表明开发者和用户在最新苹果M4硬件上安装和运行Linux可能面临潜在挑战，这可能会影响包括人工智能研究与开发在内的先进计算应用。可能需要对CPU的行为进行进一步调查。"
        },
        "source": "Hacker News",
        "link": "https://yuka.dev/blog-2026-10-02-linux-m4.html"
      },
